  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row4Member">㈱日テレイベンツ</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row5Member">㈱日本テレビアート</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row6Member">日本テレビ音楽㈱</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
