  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_OrdinarySharesSharesLessThanOneUnitMember">単元(100株)未満の株式です。</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights>
