tyle="orphans:0;widows:0;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5"&gt;ｂ．保有目的が純投資目的である投資株式&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:ShareholdingsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfGroupCompanyHoldingLargestAmountOfInvestmentSharesInGroup contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">日本テレビ放送網㈱</jpcrp_cor:NameOfGroupCompanyHoldingLargestAmountOfInvestmentSharesInGroup>
  <jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">メディア・コンテンツ事業における長期的・安定的な事業上の関係強化・維持を目的とした取得</jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesOtherThanThoseNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">テレビ放送事業等における長期的・安定的な事業上の関係強化・維持を目的とした取得</jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesOtherThanThoseNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">㈱リクルートホールディングス</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">テレビ放送事業及び事業ポートフォリオの多様化を目指す上での重要なパートナーであり、長期的・安定的な関係強化・維持のため</jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">有</jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">㈱スカパーＪＳＡＴホールディングス</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">衛星放送事業、映画コンテンツ流通における長期的・安定的な事業上の関係強化・維持のため</jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">無</jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row3Member">㈱博報堂ＤＹホールディングス</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row3Member">テレビ放送事業、イベント、映画事業等における重要なパートナーであり、長期的・安定的な関係強化・維持のため</jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
